prov:Association a sh:NodeShape ;
    rdfs:comment "Reified project↔investigator role (grant_investigators). THE authority for \"role on this project\" — canonical tokens only (trg_normalize_grant_role), with role_source provenance. A scalar on Investigator cannot express a role that varies per project (issue #283)." ;
