skos:Concept a sh:NodeShape ;
    rdfs:comment "A behavior or behavioral phenotype under study. RESERVED hook.",
        "A cognitive task/paradigm or construct. RESERVED hook.",
        "A nervous-system structure a signal is recorded from. RESERVED hook.",
        "A provenance source category (source_classes) graded by reliability — whether the who/what behind a value is human, agent, harvester, RePORTER, etc., and how much it is trusted.",
        "One of the ~32 canonical BBQS device categories (device_categories: key/label/measures[]/typical_use_cases[]). A SKOS concept scheme; each maps to a schema.org type and (via device_class_crosswalk) to external classes." ;
